<title>FINLAND: Finnish March GDP rises 5.9 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish March GDP rises 5.9 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 5.9 percent year-on-year in March, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, GDP rose 0.4 percent in March on February, SF said.</p>
<p>			 March 1997     Feb 1997	March 1996</p>
<p> Yr/yr		  +5.9 pct	+4.7 pct	-1.2 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth		+0.4 pct	+0.3 pct	+0.3 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
